  - m_Id: 17452119281754
    m_Localized: '1. Beetle store

      Browse categories and inspect stock and
      prices. All paid purchases arrive by mail; claim them into storage.


      2.
      Mailbox and storage

      Open mail from the greenhouse or market. Feed claimed
      food; move stored beetles into the greenhouse. Claimed sap and lamps can be
      used on expeditions. Install display kits from storage.


      3. Trading
      BBS

      List healthy adults for sale. Mystery pupa auctions open on even
      weeks and deliver by mail. Habitat and scenery cards remain free greenhouse
      configuration shortcuts.


      4. Seasonal themes

      Alt+T opens themes,
      Alt+M switches light/dark, Alt+H opens help.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
