    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383357
    m_Localized: Substrate nutrition {0}% / Cleanliness {1}%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383358
    m_Localized: Use one
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383359
    m_Localized: Beetle is busy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383360
    m_Localized: No beetles in your greenhouse or storage can use this supply yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383361
    m_Localized: Back to storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383362
    m_Localized: Egg incubation medium
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383363
    m_Localized: L1 fine-screened humus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383364
    m_Localized: Fermented wood substrate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383365
    m_Localized: Nutritious fungus bottle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383366
    m_Localized: Artificial pupal chamber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383367
    m_Localized: Adult beetle jelly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383368
    m_Localized: Unknown rearing supply
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383369
    m_Localized: 'For eggs: substrate nutrition +35; restores cleanliness to 100.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383370
    m_Localized: 'For L1 larvae: substrate nutrition +45; restores cleanliness to
      100.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383371
    m_Localized: 'For L2 / L3 larvae: substrate nutrition +60; restores cleanliness
      to 100.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383372
    m_Localized: 'For L2 / L3 larvae: restores nutrition and cleanliness to 100;
      +5% adult length on emergence (does not stack).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383373
    m_Localized: 'For prepupae, pupae and dormant adults: 30 days of protection;
      cleanliness 100; health +0.25.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383374
    m_Localized: 'For active adults: fullness +40; health +0.5. Dormant adults do
      not feed yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383375
    m_Localized: Keep the incubation medium clean and wait for natural hatching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383376
    m_Localized: Use fine-screened humus for newly hatched larvae and avoid frequent
      disturbance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383377
    m_Localized: Appetite is increasing. Use fermented wood substrate or a nutritious
      fungus bottle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383378
    m_Localized: The main growth stage. Substrate nutrition affects adult length
      at emergence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383379
    m_Localized: Stops feeding and prepares to pupate. Keep it undisturbed; an artificial
      pupal chamber can help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383380
    m_Localized: Metamorphosis takes place inside the pupal chamber. Adult food is
      unnecessary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383381
    m_Localized: The adult has emerged but does not feed yet. Wait for its shell
      to harden and activity to begin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383382
    m_Localized: Feeds actively and can compete or breed. Default adult life is 180
      days, excluding prior dormancy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383383
    m_Localized: "A game day must last 10\u201386400 real seconds; speed must be
      0.1\u20131000\xD7."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383384
    m_Localized: The natural clock is paused.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383385
    m_Localized: Natural clock settings saved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383386
    m_Localized: "Each stage must last 0.25\u20133650 days."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383387
    m_Localized: Life cycle updated with current stage progress preserved. Adult
      active life and dormancy are timed separately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383388
    m_Localized: Invalid time advance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383389
    m_Localized: Advance between 0 and 36500 days at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364787395383390
    m_Localized: The calendar has reached the maximum supported year.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
