    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2461402318950416
    m_Localized: Drag with the right mouse button to orbit. Scroll to zoom. Press
      Esc for settings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2461402318950417
    m_Localized: Choose a category on the left, then click an item to inspect or
      use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2461402318950418
    m_Localized: Move the mouse to choose a spot. Left-click to place, Q / E to rotate,
      Esc to cancel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2466333918679040
    m_Localized: Hold the beetle's back for 0.7 seconds until the white ring fills,
      then lift. Release the left mouse button to put it down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2466333948039168
