  - m_Id: 2466333952233509
    m_Localized: "Buying: collect purchases from your mailbox.\n\nListings: free
      to post, with a 5% sale fee. Withdraw before sale.\n\nBuyback: adults 55% of
      value, larvae 35%, specimens 60%, supplies 40% of retail.\n\nAuctions: 4 rounds.
      The highest bid at the asking price guarantees a sale; below it, acceptance
      equals the squared bid-to-asking-price ratio. Outbid or unsold bids are refunded.\n\nStock
      and offers refresh weekly; unfinished auctions also close.\nAlt+T Theme \xB7
      Alt+M Light/dark \xB7 Alt+H Help"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
